#: www/bouncing.php:39 www/customize.php:138
#: www/password-reset-via-token.php:79
msgid "Something went terribly wrong there."
msgstr "那里出了很严重的问题。"

#: www/bouncing.php:42
msgid "your email is bouncing"
msgstr "您的邮箱正在退信"

#: www/bouncing.php:55
msgid "Bouncing?  What do you mean?"
msgstr "退信？这是什么意思？"

#: www/bouncing.php:59
msgid ""
"You are a registered user. You have indicated that we can send you email.  "
"This will either be part of your watch list notifications or as an "
"announcement.  You can view these settings on the customization page (see "
"the link on the right hand side of the page)."
msgstr ""
"您是注册用户，并表示过我们可以给您发送邮件。这些邮件可能是关注列表通知，也可"
"能是公告。您可以在自定义页面查看这些设置（见页面右侧的链接）。"

#: www/bouncing.php:61
msgid ""
"The problem is that the email we are sending you is not getting to you.  It "
"is bouncing back to us.  So we have stopped sending out messages to you.  If "
"you wish to continue to receive such messages, you should update your email "
"address on the customization page."
msgstr ""
"问题在于，我们发给您的邮件无法送达，而是被退信了。因此我们不再向您发送邮件。"
"如果您希望继续收到这类邮件，请到自定义页面更新您的邮箱地址。"

#: www/bouncing.php:66
msgid "How to fix the problem"
msgstr "如何解决该问题"

#: www/bouncing.php:69
msgid "There are two things which might have caused your email to bounce:"
msgstr "有两种原因可能导致您的邮件退信："

#: www/bouncing.php:71
msgid "Your email address has changed."
msgstr "您的邮箱地址变了。"

#: www/bouncing.php:72
msgid "There was a problem with your email but it's been fixed."
msgstr "您的邮箱之前出过问题，不过现在修好了。"

#: www/bouncing.php:75
msgid ""
"If your email address has changed, please update it in your <a "
"href=\"customize.php\">account settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"如果您的邮箱地址变了，请在<a href=\"customize.php\">账户设置</a>中更新。"

#: www/bouncing.php:77
msgid ""
"If there was a problem with your email, such as your server was down, you "
"can tell FreshPorts that you want it to start using your email address again "
"by pressing the button below."
msgstr ""
"如果您的邮箱出过问题（例如您的服务器曾经宕机），您可以点击下面的按钮，告诉 "
"FreshPorts 重新开始使用您的邮箱地址。"

#: www/bouncing.php:82
